description "General Crix Madine

A strong tactician who can paint targets for team-assisted destruction, and hold his own with specialty arms.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Command Baton (Blue Saber)
-- No Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- Slows on hit
-- 10% more knockback
-- 25% shorter
- Madine's DL-18 Blaster Pistol (3)
-- Staggers on hit
-- 35% more damage/FP damage
-- 25% slower RoF
-- 30% slower mag reload
- Strike Order (8) (Minigun 3)
-- Explodes/tracks/focuses/slows on hit
-- Unblockable/hitscan charges
-- 99% less damage
-- 2800% slower RoF
-- 67% smaller splash
- Frag Grenades (2)
- Electro-Flare Grenades (2) (Pulses)
-- Burns/pushes on det

^5Powers:
- Team Energize (1)

^6Inventory:
- Forcefield
- Medpac ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (2)
- Rally
- Tracking Beacon
- Getup (2)
- 10% more knockback given

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]"